  "notes": [
   "auth=7: POST /Users/authenticatebyname (its request body carries the password in a field named Pw, which the scrubber's key list would not catch, hence 'authenticate' in the drop regex; its reply carries the access token), GET /Sessions, POST /Sessions/Capabilities/Full x2, and three web-client assets whose file names contain 'session'",
   "path=173: 159 web-client assets under /web/, plus /Branding/Css, /LiveTv/* x2, /Playback/BitrateTest x3 (octet-stream), /QuickConnect/Enabled x2, /ScheduledTasks x3, /System/ActivityLog/Entries x2, /System/Endpoint and the login page's lower-case /system/info/public, /users, /users/public",
   "non-json=2: GET /Items/{id}/Images/Primary (image/webp)",
   "other-origin=2: a connectivity probe the browser sent to a third-party origin",
   "kept the 204 replies (POST /Items/{id} metadata update, POST /Playlists/{id}/Items, DELETE /Items/{id}, POST /DisplayPreferences/usersettings); rea then excludes all four groups as non-json (mime type x-unknown)"
  ]
 },
